---
title: Any AI agent can now search our jobs, through an open standard
date: 2026-09-23
summary: 'freehire speaks OJCP — a draft open standard for how an AI agent asks a job board for jobs. No integration, no API key: an agent reads one file and knows how to search us.'
type: changelog
tags:
  - api
